ame": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.65986646884273, "y": 31.750741839762615, "width": 71.37425816023739, "height": 43.32344213649853, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["equation"]}, "id": "06OGO7Kd-o", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.65986646884273, "y": 31.750741839762615, "width": 71.37425816023739, "height": 43.32344213649853, "rotation": 0, "text": ["BOUNDED-LADDER_DFA = {(B, u, v, b) | B a DFA and u \u2192_b v by a ladder in L(B)}\n\nB-L = \"On input (B, u, v, b) Let m = |u| = |v|.\n1. For b = 1, accept if u, v \u2208 L(B) and differ in \u2264 1 place, else reject.\n2. For b > 1, repeat for each w \u2208 L(B) of length |u|\n3. Recursively test u \u2192_b/2 w and w \u2192_b/2 v [division rounds up]\n4. Accept both accept.\n5. Reject [if all fail].\"\n\nTest (B, u, v) \u2208 LADDER_DFA with B-L procedure on input (B, u, v, t) for t = |\u03a3|^m"]}, "id": "06OGO7Kd-o", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.327893175074184, "y": 75.66765578635015, "width": 15.270771513353115, "height": 4.451038575667653, "rotation": 0}, "id": "B4biApNgWE", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.327893175074184, "y": 75.66765578635015, "width": 15.270771513353115, "height": 4.451038575667653, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "B4biApNgWE", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.327893175074184, "y": 75.66765578635015, "width": 15.270771513353115, "height":